// 融媒视界 — UI kit（真实产品界面重绘：标签、模式名、按钮文案以产品为准）
// 所有界面元素都由代码绘制，不使用截图。

const THUMBS = [
  'linear-gradient(170deg,#1B2A4A 0%,#3E5C8C 45%,#C98A5A 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(160deg,#2A2038 0%,#6B4A8C 50%,#E0B27A 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(150deg,#0E2A2E 0%,#2C6B66 55%,#BFD9A6 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(165deg,#301E2A 0%,#8C4A55 55%,#E8C08A 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(175deg,#121A2E 0%,#2E4A78 50%,#9FB6D9 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(160deg,#241B14 0%,#6E4A2C 55%,#D9B27A 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(150deg,#1A1030 0%,#4A2A80 55%,#B98AE8 100%)',
  'linear-gradient(170deg,#0C1E1A 0%,#276B52 55%,#C6E0A8 100%)',
];
export const thumb = (i) => THUMBS[i % THUMBS.length];

const RAIL = [
  ['首页', '◈'], ['我的项目', '▦'], ['无限画布', '⧉'], ['AI 创作', '✦'], ['资产', '◇'],
];

export function rail(active) {
  return `<div class="rail">
    <div class="logo"><b></b><b></b></div>
    ${RAIL.map(([n, ic]) => `<div class="item ${n === active ? 'on' : ''}"><div class="ic">${ic}</div>${n}</div>`).join('')}
    <div class="bot"><div class="item"><div class="ic">?</div>新手指引</div></div>
  </div>`;
}

export function top(o) {
  return `<div class="top">
    <div class="h1">${o.title}</div>
    ${o.crumb ? `<div class="crumb">${o.crumb}</div>` : ''}
    <div class="sp"></div>
    ${(o.tags || []).map(t => `<div class="tag ${t.cls || ''}">${t.text}</div>`).join('')}
    ${o.btn ? `<div class="btn ${o.btn.acc ? 'acc' : ''}" data-a="${o.btn.key || ''}">${o.btn.text}</div>` : ''}
    ${o.btn2 ? `<div class="btn">${o.btn2}</div>` : ''}
  </div>`;
}

export function win(o) {
  return `<div class="win" style="left:${o.x}px;top:${o.y}px;width:${o.w}px;height:${o.h}px">
    <div class="tbar"><div class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <div class="ttl">${o.title || '融媒视界'}</div>
      <div class="rt">${o.rt || ''}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="app">${o.rail || ''}<div class="content">${o.top || ''}<div class="body">${o.body || ''}</div></div></div>
  </div>`;
}

export function desk(o = {}) {
  return `<div id="wall"></div><div id="menubar"><b>融媒视界</b><span>文件</span><span>编辑</span><span>视图</span><span>窗口</span><span>帮助</span><div class="r"><span>${o.clock || '10:24'}</span><span>100%</span><span>⌘</span></div></div>`;
}

/* ---------- 01 项目 ---------- */
export function projectPage(o = {}) {
  const cards = [
    ['城市之光 · 宣传片', '宣传片', '3 天前', 0],
    ['非遗新生 · 短剧', '短剧', '昨天', 1],
    ['节气海报 · 小暑', '海报', '上周', 2],
    ['城市清晨 · 短剧', '短剧', '2 周前', 3],
    ['品牌广告 · 30s', '宣传片', '3 周前', 4],
  ].map(([nm, ty, t, i]) => `<div class="pcard"><div class="th" style="background:${thumb(i)}">
      <div class="badge tag">${ty}</div></div>
      <div class="meta"><div class="nm">${nm}</div><div class="sub"><span>${t}</span><span>·</span><span>已导出</span></div></div></div>`).join('');
  return `<div class="pgrid">
    ${o.newFirst ? `<div class="newcard" data-a="new"><div class="plus">+</div>新建项目</div>` : ''}
    ${cards}
    ${o.newFirst ? '' : `<div class="newcard" data-a="new"><div class="plus">+</div>新建项目</div>`}
  </div>`;
}

/* ---------- 02 剧本 ---------- */
export const SCRIPT = [
  '场景一 · 外景 · 清晨',
  '城市还没醒，第一班地铁驶出站台。',
  '字幕：有人说，城市是钢筋水泥。',
  '镜头推近，天桥上一个人的剪影。',
  '他按下快门，城市的第一束光落在镜头里。',
  '字幕：也有人说，城市是每一个醒来的瞬间。',
  '场景二 · 内景 · 剪辑室',
  '屏幕亮着，分镜一格一格排开。',
  '字幕：融媒视界，让创意被看见。',
];

export function scriptPage(o = {}) {
  const hl = o.hl || 0;
  return `<div class="script"><div class="hd">剧本文本 · city-of-light.txt</div>
    ${SCRIPT.map((l, i) => `<div class="ln ${i <= hl ? 'hl' : ''}" data-a="ln${i}">${l}</div>`).join('')}
  </div>
  <div class="ai">
    <div class="ttl">AI 智能解析</div>
    <div class="big"><div class="n" data-a="count">${o.count ?? 0}</div><div class="u">个分镜</div></div>
    <div class="bar"><i style="width:${o.prog || 0}%"></i></div>
    <div class="row"><span>场景</span><b>${o.scenes ?? 0}</b></div>
    <div class="row"><span>角色</span><b>${o.roles ?? 0}</b></div>
    <div class="row"><span>台词</span><b>${o.lines ?? 0}</b></div>
    <div class="row"><span>预估成片</span><b>02:30</b></div>
    ${o.done ? `<div class="ok">✓ 解析完成 · 40 个分镜已生成</div>` : ''}
    <div class="btn ${o.parsing ? '' : 'acc'}" data-a="parse" style="justify-content:center">${o.parsing ? '解析中…' : '智能解析'}</div>
  </div>`;
}

/* ---------- 03 分镜 ---------- */
export const SHOTS = [
  ['01', '3.2s', '城市还没醒，地铁驶出站台', 0],
  ['02', '2.4s', '天桥上，一个人的剪影', 1],
  ['03', '1.8s', '他按下快门', 3],
  ['04', '3.6s', '第一束光落在镜头里', 2],
  ['05', '2.2s', '字幕：有人说，城市是钢筋水泥', 4],
  ['06', '2.8s', '镜头掠过楼群', 5],
  ['07', '2.6s', '剪辑室，屏幕亮着', 6],
  ['08', '3.0s', '分镜一格一格排开', 7],
  ['09', '2.2s', '字幕：也有人说，城市是醒来的瞬间', 0],
  ['10', '2.4s', '成片预览，光落在画面上', 1],
];

export function storyboardPage(o = {}) {
  const n = o.shown || SHOTS.length;
  return `<div class="sbwrap">
    <div class="sbgrid">
      ${SHOTS.slice(0, n).map(([no, du, line, ti], i) => `<div class="sb ${o.hot === i ? 'hot' : ''}" data-a="sb${i}">
        <div class="th" style="background:${thumb(ti)}"><div class="no">SHOT ${no}</div><div class="du">${du}</div></div>
        <div class="meta"><b>镜头 ${no}</b><br>${line}</div>
      </div>`).join('')}
    </div>
  </div>`;
}

/* ---------- 04 无限画布 ---------- */
export const NODES = [
  ['剧本节点', 'city-of-light.txt · 9 段', 0, 380, 110, '#CFAAFF'],
  ['分镜节点', '40 个分镜', 1, 740, 110, '#3DDCFF'],
  ['生图节点', '4 张 · 16:9', 2, 740, 330, '#CFAAFF'],
  ['视频节点', '5s · 720p', 3, 1100, 330, '#3DDCFF'],
  ['配音节点', '林声 · 男声', 4, 740, 560, '#FFB547'],
  ['音乐节点', '城市清晨', 5, 1100, 560, '#3BE08A'],
];

export function canvasPage(o = {}) {
  const on = o.on || [];
  const nodes = NODES.map(([nm, sub, i, x, y, col]) => `<div class="node ${on.includes(i) ? 'on' : ''}" style="left:${x}px;top:${y}px;width:264px" data-a="n${i}">
      ${i === 0 ? '<div class="badge">剧本</div>' : ''}
      <div class="nh"><span class="dot" style="background:${col}"></span>${nm}</div>
      <div class="nc" style="font-size:12.5px">${sub}</div>
      ${i >= 2 && i <= 3 ? `<div class="thumb" style="height:104px;background:${thumb(i)}"></div>` : ''}
    </div>`).join('');
  const wire = (a, b) => {
    const A = NODES[a], B = NODES[b];
    const x1 = A[3] + 264, y1 = A[4] + 40, x2 = B[3], y2 = B[4] + 40;
    return `<path d="M${x1} ${y1} C${x1 + 70} ${y1}, ${x2 - 70} ${y2}, ${x2} ${y2}" stroke="#5A4A82" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>`;
  };
  return `<div class="cv" data-a="cv">
    <svg class="wires">${wire(0, 1)}${wire(1, 2)}${wire(2, 3)}${wire(1, 4)}${wire(4, 5)}${wire(3, 5)}</svg>
    <div class="cvbar"><div class="tag">组镜模式</div><div class="tag">6 个节点</div><div class="tag acc">自动布局</div></div>
    ${nodes}
    <div class="cvzoom">100% · 已保存</div>
  </div>`;
}

/* ---------- 05 生成 ---------- */
export function generatePage(o = {}) {
  return `<div class="gen">
    <div class="gcol" style="flex:1.05">
      <div class="card grow"><div class="ch">生图节点 · 4 张候选<span class="sp"></span><span class="tag cy">720p</span></div>
        <div class="img4">${[0, 1, 2, 3].map(i => `<div class="im" style="background:${thumb(i)}"><span class="num">0${i + 1}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ch">视频节点 · 5s<span class="sp"></span><span class="tag">首尾帧生视频</span></div>
        <div class="vidcard"><div class="vidframe" style="background:${thumb(0)}">
          <div class="play">▶</div><div class="prog"><i style="width:${o.vprog || 72}%"></i></div><div class="pt">${o.vprog || 72}% · 3.6s</div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gcol">
      <div class="card"><div class="ch">配音工作台<span class="sp"></span><span class="tag acc">林声 · 男声</span></div>
        <div class="wave"><div class="wv">${Array.from({ length: 48 }, (_, i) => `<i style="height:${18 + Math.round(28 * Math.abs(Math.sin(i * 0.7 + 1))) + (i % 5) * 4}%"></i>`).join('')}</div>
        <div class="who"><span>00:06 / 00:24</span><span>·</span><span>语速 1.0×</span><span>·</span><span>已对齐字幕</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ch">音乐创作 · 3 条候选<span class="sp"></span><span class="tag">AI 生成</span></div>
        <div class="tracks">${['城市清晨 · 温暖叙事', '钢筋森林 · 低频脉冲', '第一束光 · 钢琴独奏'].map((n, i) => `<div class="trk ${i === 0 ? 'on' : ''}"><span class="nm">${n}</span><span class="sp"></span><span class="eq">${[10, 16, 12, 18, 14].map(h => `<i style="height:${h}px"></i>`).join('')}</span><span class="tag ${i === 0 ? 'acc' : ''}">${i === 0 ? '选用' : '试听'}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card grow"><div class="ch">成片节点 · 待合成<span class="sp"></span><span class="tag acc">8 个镜头已就绪</span></div>
        <div style="flex:1;padding:10px"><div style="height:100%;border-radius:9px;background:${thumb(0)};position:relative">
          <div style="position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:10px;font-family:Mono;font-size:11px;color:#fff;opacity:.85">02:30 · 1080p · 待导出</div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>`;
}

